#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:1
msgid "Local Daemon Store"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:3
msgid "**Store URL format**: `daemon`, `unix://`_path_"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:5
msgid ""
"This store type accesses a Nix store by talking to a Nix daemon listening on "
"the Unix domain socket _path_."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:8
msgid ""
"When _path_ is not specified (i.e. the `daemon` pseudo-URL or bare `unix://"
"`), the socket path is determined as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:11
msgid ""
"The [`NIX_DAEMON_SOCKET_PATH`](../../command-ref/env-common.md#env-"
"NIX_DAEMON_SOCKET_PATH) environment variable, if set."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:13
msgid ""
"Otherwise, `daemon-socket/socket` within the [`state`](#store-local-daemon-"
"store-state) directory."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:17
msgid "Settings"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:19
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-log\">[`log`](#store-local-daemon-store-"
"log)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:21
msgid "Directory where Nix stores log files."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:23
msgid ""
"Defaults to [`NIX_LOG_DIR`](../../command-ref/env-common.md#env-NIX_LOG_DIR) "
"when [`root`](#store-local-daemon-store-root) is not set."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:25
msgid "**Default:** `/nix/var/log/nix`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:27
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-max-connection-age\">[`max-connection-"
"age`](#store-local-daemon-store-max-connection-age)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:29
msgid "Maximum age of a connection before it is closed."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:31
msgid "**Default:** `4294967295`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:33
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-max-connections\">[`max-connections`]"
"(#store-local-daemon-store-max-connections)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:35
msgid "Maximum number of concurrent connections to the Nix daemon."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:37
msgid "**Default:** `1`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:39
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-path-info-cache-size\">[`path-info-cache-"
"size`](#store-local-daemon-store-path-info-cache-size)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:41
msgid "Size of the in-memory store path metadata cache."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:43
msgid "**Default:** `65536`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:45
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-priority\">[`priority`](#store-local-"
"daemon-store-priority)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:47
msgid ""
"Priority of this store when used as a [substituter](../../command-ref/conf-"
"file.md#conf-substituters). A lower value means a higher priority."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:50
msgid "**Default:** `0`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:52
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-real\">[`real`](#store-local-daemon-"
"store-real)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:54
msgid "Physical path of the Nix store."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:56
msgid ""
"Defaults to [`store`](#store-local-daemon-store-store) when [`root`](#store-"
"local-daemon-store-root) is not set."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:58
#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:82
msgid "**Default:** `/nix/store`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:60
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-root\">[`root`](#store-local-daemon-"
"store-root)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:62
msgid "Directory prefixed to all other paths."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:64
msgid "**Default:** \\``"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:66
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-state\">[`state`](#store-local-daemon-"
"store-state)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:68
msgid "Directory where Nix stores state."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:70
msgid ""
"Defaults to [`NIX_STATE_DIR`](../../command-ref/env-common.md#env-"
"NIX_STATE_DIR) when [`root`](#store-local-daemon-store-root) is not set."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:72
msgid "**Default:** `/dummy`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:74
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-store\">[`store`](#store-local-daemon-"
"store-store)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:76
msgid "Logical location of the Nix store, usually `/nix/store`."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:78
msgid ""
"Defaults to [`NIX_STORE_DIR`](../../command-ref/env-common.md#env-"
"NIX_STORE_DIR) if unset."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:80
msgid ""
"Note that you can only copy store paths between stores if they have the same "
"`store` setting."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:84
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-system-features\">[`system-features`]"
"(#store-local-daemon-store-system-features)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:86
msgid ""
"Optional [system features](../../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-system-"
"features) available on the system this store uses to build derivations."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:88
msgid "Example: `\"kvm\"`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:90
msgid "**Default:** _machine-specific_"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:92
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-trusted\">[`trusted`](#store-local-"
"daemon-store-trusted)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:94
msgid ""
"Whether paths from this store can be used as substitutes even if they are "
"not signed by a key listed in the [`trusted-public-keys`](../../command-ref/"
"conf-file.md#conf-trusted-public-keys) setting."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:99
#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:105
msgid "**Default:** `false`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:101
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-daemon-store-want-mass-query\">[`want-mass-query`]"
"(#store-local-daemon-store-want-mass-query)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-daemon-store.md:103
msgid ""
"Whether this store can be queried efficiently for path validity when used as "
"a [substituter](../../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-substituters)."
msgstr ""
